nd washing and  respiratory hygiene  covering up coughs with disposable  hankies or  even with your sleeve remain the most  important and  effective measures we can all adopt to  prevent the spread of the virus  so please above all else continue to  follow the rules that we have set out  stay at home except for essential  purposes such as buying food or medicine  or exercising if you do leave the house  you should stay two metres apart from  other people and you should not meet up  with people from other households  and of course you should wash your hands  regularly and  thoroughly i know as i say every day but  every day it becomes  ever more true that sticking to these  rules is really  really difficult but it remains  essential  it is how all of us can help to continue  to slow down the spread of the virus  continue to protect our nhs from being  overwhelmed and continue to save  lives so thank you for sticking with it  and please  continue to do so
 

